{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミュージカル「SPY×FAMILY」初日まで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと少し。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ44G3J3E9WYM6S17RTH5ZGV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々書きたいことはありますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは無事舞台が終わってから書こうかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しさが溢れている現場です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何も知らない私に、色んなことをみなさんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教えてくれます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヨルの人柄や、凛とした姿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵なヨルさんをしっかり演じられるよう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もあと1週間、無駄にせず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなことに挑戦出来たらなと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ44G4H2NA74YKBGAX3KTM48","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"}],"source":"archive"}